  "title": "Cardamom Chicken with Salt and Pepper Crust",
  "description": "Chicken thighs rest in a flavorful marinade of garlic, soy sauce, vinegar, honey, and cardamom, then are finished with coarse salt and pepper.",
  "authors": [
